 Project Design Phase

## Project Title
Implement Client Script and UI Policy for Incident Management in ServiceNow

## Design
The Incident form is designed using Client Scripts and UI Policies.

## Client Script
Client Scripts are used to validate fields and perform actions dynamically based on user input.

## UI Policy
UI Policies are used to make fields mandatory, read-only, visible, or hidden based on conditions.

## Incident Fields
Caller, Short Description, Description, Category, Subcategory, Impact, Urgency, Priority, Assignment Group, Assigned To, and State.

## Expected Result
The Incident form should work dynamically and provide a simple and user-friendly experience.
